Third-party material: the ADIF specification
--------------------------------------------

The files in src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/316/ and src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/317/
(and their xml/, csv/, tsv/, xlsx/ and ods/ subfolders) are the Amateur Data
Interchange Format (ADIF) specification exports, versions 3.1.6 and 3.1.7, in every
format ADIF publishes, produced by the ADIF Developers Group and published at
https://adif.org.uk/. They are redistributed unmodified; each folder's MANIFEST.json
lists their SHA-256s, and a test checks that they stay byte-identical to ADIF's
published files.

They are ADIF's work, not ours. This project's GPL-3.0-or-later licence covers our
own code and files. It does not cover the ADIF specification files, and we claim no
rights in them. ADIF publishes the exports so developers can "generate (for example)
program data or SQL files" from them, which is how this project uses them.

Exceptions, which are ours:
- src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/316/enumerations_country.json
- src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/317/enumerations_country.json
  The Country enumeration is derived by this project (see the file's "Derived" block);
  ADIF does not publish it in this form.
- src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/adif_catalog.json and adif_meta.json.
- src/adif_mcp/resources/spec/316/MANIFEST.json and 317/MANIFEST.json (the checksum lists).
